  "body": "## What's Changed\n* chore(deps): Bump astral-sh/setup-uv from 10.0.0 to 10.0.1 in the github-actions group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/494\n* feat(claude-agent-sdk): opt-in setting_sources for target-repo skills by @joaomena in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/502\n* feat(providers): always-on client-side context compaction for pydantic-ai providers (claude, openai) by @hertznsk in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/503\n* fix(providers): retry transient OpenAI stream errors by @hertznsk in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/506\n* fix(providers): guard compaction against token estimate drift by @hertznsk in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/507\n* chore(deps): Bump httpcore2 from 2.3.0 to 2.10.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/515\n* chore(deps): Bump @vitest/mocker and vitest in /src/conductor/web/frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/520\n* chore(deps): Bump httpx2 from 2.10.0 to 2.12.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/516\n* feat(claude-agent-sdk): select the project settings tier with settings_dir by @throup in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/514\n* fix(providers): prevent concurrent registry creation by @ldavidgomez in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/512\n* Preserve agent conversation across validator retries by @hertznsk in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/511\n* fix(gates): read a terminal dialog reply as one multi-line turn by @throup in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/510\n* chore(release): cut 0.1.37 by @jrob5756 in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/521\n\n## New Contributors\n* @joaomena made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/502\n* @throup made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/pull/514\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/microsoft/conductor/compare/v0.1.36...v0.1.37",
